title: Jinx_Recruitment
---
===
Jinx_Intro
===

Jinx: WHOA! Don't sneak up on me! I almost activated the... wait, is that a Signal-Walker?
Jinx: Oh this is SO cool. I've read about you! Your frequency, like, sings through the Rust!

-> You're Jinx, the tech genius?
    === Jinx_Tech ===
-> You seem... energetic.
    === Jinx_Energy ===
-> I need a tech specialist. Interested?
    === Jinx_Offer ===

===
Jinx_Tech
===

Jinx: 'Genius' is a strong word. 'Certified disaster-wrangler' is more accurate.
Jinx: But yeah, I can make pretty much anything talk. Machines, terminals, even some of the Rust-tech.

<<set $jinx_loyalty = $jinx_loyalty + 10>>

-> I need someone who can handle ancient tech.
    === Jinx_Offer ===

===
Jinx_Energy
===

Jinx: Energy is my MIDDLE NAME. Well, no, it's actually '7-B', but that's a whole thing.
Jinx: I've been working on something BIG. A device that can, get this, *intercept and translate* ORACLE's raw Signal!

<<set $jinx_loyalty = $jinx_loyalty + 15>>

-> That sounds incredibly dangerous. I love it. You're in.
    === Jinx_Accepted ===

===
Jinx_Offer
===

Jinx: Interested? INCREDIBLY. I've been dying to see what's beyond Sector 8.
Jinx: But fair warning — I blow things up. Sometimes on purpose. Sometimes not. That's the fun part!

-> I'll take my chances. Welcome aboard.
    === Jinx_Accepted ===

===
Jinx_Accepted
===

Jinx: YES! I'm gonna see the WHOLE wasteland!
Jinx: Oh, here — I built this thingy. It does... something. Usually helpful!

<<set $jinx_loyalty = 30>>
<<set $jinx_recruited = true>>
<<set $active_companions += 1>>
<<set $party: "Jinx" = true>>
<<set $quest_jinx_big_score = "active">>

Jinx <<companion_join>>
<<give_item pulse_pistol>>

-> Welcome to the crew, Jinx. Try not to blow us up.
    === Jinx_Joined ===

===
Jinx_Joined
===

Jinx: No promises! Let's GO! <<signal>>
    -> Let's roll. (End)
